<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-S&amp;P affirms Advance Bank ratings.</title>
<headline>RTRS-S&amp;P affirms Advance Bank ratings.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp said on Wednesday it had affirmed its &quot;A&quot; long term and A-1 short term counterparty ratings of Advance Bank Australia Ltd and has removed the bank from creditwatch with negative implications, where they were placed on October 14.</p>
</text>
